Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 00:49:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Restore comparison-worker routing for concrete
 non-knowledge proofs

The cache/comparison/recommended-search block sat after an unconditional
return inside the knowledge-goal branch, so the following else belonged
to IsKnowledge. Eligible uncached concrete goals now reach
CompareSearchModes in ordinary mode. Knowledge search, research and
evaluation shortcut skips, cache hits, and unsuccessful worker outcomes
stay distinct.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
